From 491d6d795fb66a478b368723b2becfd1bb124133 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: meka3 <dosreishugo.etu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:43:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix pairing popup, maneuver distance and next action

- disable_panel_bluetooth.sh: remove the Pi OS taskbar Bluetooth widget,
  whose GTK "Pairing successful" dialog pops over the fullscreen
  dashboard (it watches Paired=true on every device, so no agent can
  suppress it). Reversible with --restore; called from SETUP.sh.
- NavRelay: read notification texts with getCharSequence (Maps uses
  spannable titles, getString returned null and lost the distance),
  accept non-breaking spaces, stop matching "12 min" as "12 m", and
  classify ETA lines so they are never used as action or distance.
  Sends "eta" and distance -1 when unknown.
- main.c: show "-- m" for unknown distance, ETA on the bottom line,
  fold accents to ASCII since the built-in Montserrat fonts lack them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mQKZ4xqeG7ECaGPiWRhWe
